   "box": "17x3",
   "face": 141
  },
  {
   "id": "s300:00582",
   "op": "15",
   "jp": "だったらなんでお前の親父は\n白き羽なのに・・・",
   "en": "Then how come your old man, a White Wing himself...",
   "box": "17x3",
   "face": 141
  },
  {
   "id": "s300:005c2",
   "op": "15",
   "jp": "同じ白き羽の首ばかりを・・・",
   "en": "only ever... other White Wings' heads...",
   "box": "17x3",
   "face": 141
  },
  {
   "id": "s300:005f2",
   "op": "15",
   "jp": "斧で切り落としたりしてるんだ？！",
