   "box": "17x3",
   "face": 140
  },
  {
   "id": "s300:0075e",
   "op": "15",
   "jp": "お前達一家が奴隷じゃない事が・・・裏切りの何よりの証拠さ・・・！",
   "en": "Your family not being slaves... that's the best proof you're traitors...!",
   "box": "17x3",
   "face": 140
  },
  {
